        "created_at": "2015-01-10T06:47:05.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I would say no, because it was already in play before it copies all of the ongoing cards. Also, if that were the case, then you wouldn't be able to copy Mr. Fixer or The Naturalist, since it entering play would destroy all of their forms and styles.</p>",
