        "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/g/e495f1/{size}.png",
        "created_at": "2015-03-19T17:31:03.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Can we get a ruling on cards on another player's field that disappear before UYITG is discarded such as Scholar's Expect the Worst. Does Setback also lose the ability of the card the moment it leaves? If it does leave before UYITG is destroyed does that mean when Scholar's Expect the Worst leaves play on Scholar's turn does that mean Guise gets to heal as well?</p>",
