        "raw": "[quote=\"phantaskippy\"]\n\nHowever, if guise was before scholar in turn order, at the start of Guide&#39;s turn the copied text would trigger, healing Guise and destroying uh, yeah I&#39;m that guy. &nbsp;Because in this instance it is the copied text on Guise&#39;s card acting.\n\n[/quote]\n\nJust a clarification, it&#39;s not Guise being before The Scholar in turn order, but Uh, Yeah, I&#39;m That Guy! being in play before Expect the Worst (unless Fixed Point is in play of course). Guise just gets more use out of the reducing damage to 0 if Guise&#39;s turn is before The Scholar.\n",
